{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111435","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111435/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111435/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111435/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111435","id":3497253421,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6szBza","number":111435,"title":"GDExtension: Allow forward-declaring `GDVIRTUAL`","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":580537003,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1ODA1MzcwMDM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdextension","name":"topic:gdextension","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":6,"created_at":"2025-10-09T00:27:32Z","updated_at":"2025-10-14T14:55:02Z","closed_at":"2025-10-14T14:54:46Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111435","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111435","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111435.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111435.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"- Fixes #101002\r\n- Helps address #111218\r\n\r\nOriginally, I attempted to solve the enum issue by resolving Enum data earlier. While that idea can eventually be integrated, it *wouldn't* work for a similar but related issue: forward-declared types. Because these macros cause the functions to be defined immediately, this necessitates files with virtual methods to include headers for *all arguments*, which runs completely counter to current attempts to strip down header chains\r\n\r\nThis PR addresses this roadblock in a more explicit manner: separate macros to declare & implement virtual functions! While this does end up increasing the size of `gdvirtual.gen.inc` (480KiB → 730KiB), there's no change in the logic of an expanded `GDVIRTUAL*` macro. Instead, the size comes from accomodating the two new macros: `DECLARE_GDVIRTUAL*` and `IMPLEMENT_GDVIRTUAL*`, for forward-declares and implementation respectively\r\n\r\nIntegrated arbitrarily on `Resource` to showcase functionality","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111435/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111435/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}